      "created_at": "2012-05-12T23:23:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Question: is this MTG?<br>\nAnswer: No<br>\nQuestion:Why should you then use a rule from MTG?<br>\nAnswer: ?</p>\n<p>Unless anyone can find a rule that contradicts me a card that reaches 0 HP is destroyed.</p>\n<p>EDIT:<br>\nOn further thought I seem to remember something floating around here stating that ‘destroy’ means remove from play to the discard pile, so any card removed from play to the discard pile is also destroyed (though it is possible I am misremembering this, I will do a search and see if I can back this up)</p>",
